{"id":"f92b2b6a2706404b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-p-morphism.md","title":"Surjective Bounded Morphism","display":"df-p-morphism — Surjective Bounded Morphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-p-morphism","aliases":["89-df-p-morphism","p-morphism","有界态射","bounded morphism"],"display":"df-p-morphism — Surjective Bounded Morphism","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-p-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-p-morphism</span><span>p-morphism</span><span>有界态射</span><span>bounded morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-morphism — Surjective Bounded Morphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F&#39;=(W&#39;,R&#39;)\">\\(F&#39;=(W&#39;,R&#39;)\\)</span> 是非空 Kripke 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:W\\to W&#39;\">\\(f:W\\to W&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;F,F^\\prime)\">\\(\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;F,F^\\prime)\\)</span> 是下述定义的映射、源框架、目标框架三参数谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;F,F&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nf[W]=W&#39;\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall w,v\\in W\\ (wRv\\to f(w)R&#39;f(v))\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall u\\in W&#39;\\ \n(f(w)R&#39;u\\to\\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv\\land f(v)=u)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;F,F&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nf[W]=W&#39;\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall w,v\\in W\\ (wRv\\to f(w)R&#39;f(v))\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall u\\in W&#39;\\ \n(f(w)R&#39;u\\to\\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv\\land f(v)=u)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里沿用已有“满射有界态射”的约定。若目标赋值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V&#39;\">\\(V&#39;\\)</span>，必须取源赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(p)=f^{-1}[V&#39;(p)]\">\\(V(p)=f^{-1}[V&#39;(p)]\\)</span>，才有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R,V),w\\models A\">\\((W,R,V),w\\models A\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;),f(w)\\models A\">\\((W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;),f(w)\\models A\\)</span>；证明对子公式归纳，盒情形分别用 forth、back。\n生成子框架的包含映射满足 forth/back，但通常不是到整个原框架的满射，不能自动称为本定义中的 p-态射。此为标准模态语义补充工具；原书第 4–5 章的相关方法采用生成子模型与树展开，未把这里的名称当作原书术语。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F'=(W',R')","display":false},{"tex":"f:W\\to W'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;F,F^\\prime)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;F,F')\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nf[W]=W'\\\\\n{}\\land{}&\\forall w,v\\in W\\ (wRv\\to f(w)R'f(v))\\\\\n{}\\land{}&\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall u\\in W'\\ \n(f(w)R'u\\to\\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv\\land f(v)=u)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V'","display":false},{"tex":"V(p)=f^{-1}[V'(p)]","display":false},{"tex":"(W,R,V),w\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"(W',R',V'),f(w)\\models A","display":false}],"bytes":1388,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a019df3a337399a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f$ : p-态射 (see [[89-df-p-morphism]])"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-372","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-p-morphism]]"}],"outgoing":["c78d4bf1505bda5c"]}